==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Yuma Kuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

